{"3256040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shardbreakers", "steam_appid": 3256040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/f979a872f151a59eb5482d3989827f03.poster.avif?t=1788309108\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/f979a872f151a59eb5482d3989827f03.webm?t=1788309108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/f979a872f151a59eb5482d3989827f03.mp4?t=1788309108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Shardbreakers, you don’t just collect upgrades - you build a spell engine. Socket Shards to decide what triggers what and chain spells together. Your weapon attacks automatically and lighter spells trigger on their own, while your most decisive spells remain under your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/177354792ed9b98cc354929b9342d612.avif?t=1788309108\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras_big/177354792ed9b98cc354929b9342d612.webp?t=1788309108 width=1560 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your Skill and Condition Shards to decide what triggers, what fires, and how your magic behaves. Arrange them into Resonance patterns to amplify their power. Then take your engine into battle and watch your choices come to life as spells trigger, chain, and cascade through combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/632b79a027def6a9e707e65c96add9cb.poster.avif?t=1788309108\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/632b79a027def6a9e707e65c96add9cb.webm?t=1788309108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/632b79a027def6a9e707e65c96add9cb.mp4?t=1788309108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/ef54ef9178802df045e5b0894b22cec7.avif?t=1788309108\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras_big/ef54ef9178802df045e5b0894b22cec7.webp?t=1788309108 width=1560 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into dense, readable combat rooms built to test your ideas in motion. As your spells trigger, chain, and cascade, you can see exactly why your build works, or where it falls short.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full room isn’t just danger. It’s fuel that makes your build louder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/452167fc659c5a7779f4d20fd96f23ff.poster.avif?t=1788309108\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/452167fc659c5a7779f4d20fd96f23ff.webm?t=1788309108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/452167fc659c5a7779f4d20fd96f23ff.mp4?t=1788309108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/e138f3cc91f4b9134c1b626f4c600cb3.avif?t=1788309108\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras_big/e138f3cc91f4b9134c1b626f4c600cb3.webp?t=1788309108 width=1560 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the trigger, change the arrangement, change the result. Build around spreading effects, cascading reactions, powerful payoff spells, or entirely different combinations of Shards. Each run gives you another way to solve the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/a00944b7908d775cd1c65a991f3ffe20.poster.avif?t=1788309108\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/a00944b7908d775cd1c65a991f3ffe20.webm?t=1788309108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/a00944b7908d775cd1c65a991f3ffe20.mp4?t=1788309108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/5ec283fb699ffd02d1a16e4e4588d9f1.avif?t=1788309108\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras_big/5ec283fb699ffd02d1a16e4e4588d9f1.webp?t=1788309108 width=1560 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run asks you to make trade-offs. Choose your route, spend your resources, reroll what doesn’t fit, upgrade what does, or recover before the next fight. Don’t just take what looks powerful - choose what your build actually needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/a6df6861bad0e293b879c61d21a1b5fa.poster.avif?t=1788309108\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/a6df6861bad0e293b879c61d21a1b5fa.webm?t=1788309108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/a6df6861bad0e293b879c61d21a1b5fa.mp4?t=1788309108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/28d1b76df960a08fec387b13d226b691.avif?t=1788309108\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras_big/28d1b76df960a08fec387b13d226b691.webp?t=1788309108 width=1560 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new Shards and expand the possibilities of your spell engine. Start from different foundations with the Hunter, Arcanist, and Knight, then shape each run through the engine you build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hero sets your starting frame, but the spell engine you author is entirely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/a736ff4ac1fd44476d65cc521dc4089d.poster.avif?t=1788309108\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/a736ff4ac1fd44476d65cc521dc4089d.webm?t=1788309108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/a736ff4ac1fd44476d65cc521dc4089d.mp4?t=1788309108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WISHLIST SHARDBREAKERS NOW!!!</strong><br><i>Demo coming soon.</i> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/f979a872f151a59eb5482d3989827f03.poster.avif?t=1788309108\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/f979a872f151a59eb5482d3989827f03.webm?t=1788309108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/f979a872f151a59eb5482d3989827f03.mp4?t=1788309108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Shardbreakers, you don’t just collect upgrades - you build a spell engine. Socket Shards to decide what triggers what and chain spells together. Your weapon attacks automatically and lighter spells trigger on their own, while your most decisive spells remain under your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/177354792ed9b98cc354929b9342d612.avif?t=1788309108\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras_big/177354792ed9b98cc354929b9342d612.webp?t=1788309108 width=1560 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your Skill and Condition Shards to decide what triggers, what fires, and how your magic behaves. Arrange them into Resonance patterns to amplify their power. Then take your engine into battle and watch your choices come to life as spells trigger, chain, and cascade through combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/632b79a027def6a9e707e65c96add9cb.poster.avif?t=1788309108\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/632b79a027def6a9e707e65c96add9cb.webm?t=1788309108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/632b79a027def6a9e707e65c96add9cb.mp4?t=1788309108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/ef54ef9178802df045e5b0894b22cec7.avif?t=1788309108\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras_big/ef54ef9178802df045e5b0894b22cec7.webp?t=1788309108 width=1560 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into dense, readable combat rooms built to test your ideas in motion. As your spells trigger, chain, and cascade, you can see exactly why your build works, or where it falls short.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full room isn’t just danger. It’s fuel that makes your build louder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/452167fc659c5a7779f4d20fd96f23ff.poster.avif?t=1788309108\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256040/extras/452167fc659c5a7779f4d20fd96